ip-text":"使用CJ支付代理服务的订单奖金","payment-agency-cj-order-amount-x":"CJ订单金额 (X)","payment-agency-cj-payment-agency-service-contract":"CJ支付代理服务合同","payment-agency-cjdropshipping-maintains-strong-partnerships-with-multiple-gateways":"CJdropshipping与多个网关保持强大的合作伙伴关系，确保更好的风险控制和更稳定的帐户。","payment-agency-connected-to-major-gateways-with-success-rates-at-an-industry-leading-level":"连接到主要网关，成功率达到行业领先水平。","payment-agency-cooperative-partners":"合作伙伴","payment-agency-deposit":"存款","payment-agency-important-notes":"重要说明","payment-agency-industry-leading-payment-success-rate":"行业领先的支付成功率","payment-agency-lease-fee":"租赁费","payment-agency-lease-fee-tooltip-text":"使用CJ支付代理服务的订单的租赁费","payment-agency-leasing-fees-start-as-low-as-1":"租赁费用开始低至1%。在促销期间，根据您的CJdropshipping购买量享受额外的1%-2% 补贴。","payment-agency-leasing-fees-start-as-low-as-1-during-promotions":"租赁费用开始低至1%。在促销期间，根据您的CJdropshipping购买量享受额外的1%-2% 补贴。","payment-agency-low-leasing-fees-with-promotional-subsidies":"低租赁费和促销补贴","payment-agency-new-customers-with-new-stores":"新商店的新客户","payment-agency-once-your-account-reaches-the-withdrawal-threshold":"一旦您的帐户达到提款阈值，您可以请求付款。您的客户经理将与财务团队协调，在3个工作日内转移资金。","payment-agency-once-your-account-reaches-the-withdrawal-threshold-7":"一旦您的帐户达到提款阈值，您可以请求付款。您的客户经理将与财务团队协调，在7个工作日内转移资金。","payment-agency-once-your-application-for-a-payment-account-is-approved-by-an-account-manager":"一旦您的付款帐户申请获得客户经理的批准，我们将在7至15个工作日内为您设置帐户。","payment-agency-order-amount-tooltip-text":"使用CJ支付代理服务的商店每月CJ订单购买","payment-agency-others":"其他","payment-agency-pricing":"零售价设置","payment-agency-pricing-for-growth-not-for-headaches":"为增长而定价，而不是为头痛而定价","payment-agency-promotion-note-content":"2.PayPal和Stripe支付网关子账户的定价需要单独查询。有关详细信息，请参阅","payment-agency-promotion-note-content-2":"CJdropshipping.com保留对此促销活动的最终解释权。","payment-agency-promotion-notes-1":"1.促销时间: 2025年9月15日-2025年12月31日","payment-agency-promotion-period":"1.促销期间: 2025年9月15日-2025年12月31日","payment-agency-promotion-period-title":"促销期","payment-agency-promotion-period-tooltip-text":"在促销期间注册和连接新商店。","payment-agency-register-a-cjdropshipping-account-and-authorize-your-store":"注册CJdropshipping帐户并授权您的商店","payment-agency-register-a-cjdropshipping-account-and-authorize-your-store.":"注册CJdropshipping帐户并授权您的商店","payment-agency-regular":"常规","payment-agency-seamless-support-for-multiple-dtc-websites":"对多个DTC网站的无缝支持","payment-agency-start-scaling-now-lets-build-your-success":"立即开始扩展: 让我们建立您的成功","payment-agency-step":"步骤","payment-agency-strong-partnerships-and-stable-accounts":"强大的合作伙伴关系和稳定的客户","payment-agency-supports-credit-cards-e-wallets-apple-pay-google-pay-bnpl-and-local-payment-methods":"支持信用卡、电子钱包、Apple Pay、Google Pay、BNPL和本地付款方式。","payment-agency-we-ll-help-you-set-up-your-payment-account":"我们将帮助您设置付款帐户，并持续监控任何潜在的付款问题。","payment-agency-wide-range-of-payment-methods":"广泛的付款方式","payment-agency-works-seamlessly-with-shopify-woocommerce-bigcommerce-and-other-dtc-platforms":"与Shopify、WooCommerce、BigCommerce和其他DTC平台无缝协作。","payment-pay-with-card":"用卡支付","payment-pay-with-wallet":"支付与{{platformName}}钱包","payment-wire-transfer":"电汇","printondemand-startdesign":"开始设计","product-actual-product-photo":"实物图","product-card-added-to-queue":"已添加到队列","product-card-added-to-queue-fail":"添加刊登失败","product-card-free-shipping":"包邮","product-card-list-btn":"刊登","product-card-list-with-on-click":"一键铺货","product-card-normal-inventory-tip":"由于每天的市场变化，供应商的真实库存无法跟踪。要确认，请联系您的代理商。","product-card-please-check-the-product-in-queue.-it-has-been-added-to-queue.":"您已添加该产品到队列。","product-card-print-on-demand":"按需定制","product-card-verify-inventory-tip":"{{siteName}}已确认产品质量和准确的库存。预计48小时内发货。","product-card-view-more":"查看更多","product-listing-notice":"商品上架通知","product-marketing-picture":"营销图","product-marketing-video":"营销视频","product-place-an-order":"去下单","product-th-buyflow-confirm":"确认","product-th-delivery-or-self-pickup":"自提订单商品","product-th-delivery-self-pickup":"送货和自提","product-th-delivery-self-pickup-desc":"您需要前往提货地址，在确认您已经支付物流费用的前提下，拿走您购买订单的商品。","product-th-ordering-process":"订购流程","product-th-product-procurement":"产品采购","product-th-product-procurement-title-desc":"抱歉，由于缺乏计算运费的必要信息，您只需现在支付产品费用，稍后再补交运费。","product-th-product-procurement-title-desc-no-property":"抱歉，由于缺乏计算运费的必要信息，您只需现在支付产品费用，一旦产品信息得到确认，稍后再补交运费","product-th-product-procurement-title-desc-no-weight":"抱歉，由于缺乏计算运费的必要信息，您只需现在支付产品费用，一旦产品信息得到确认，稍后再补交运费。","product-th-product-procurement-title-desc-normal":"您现在只需要支付产品费用，而不考虑运费，直到产品到达当地仓库。","product-th-products-arrived":"产品到达当地仓库","product-th-products-arrived-desc":"订单商品达到1688.tech本地仓后，会再次提醒您支付商品物流费用，同时会告知您订单的提货地点。","product-th-products-arrived-desc-n":"一旦您的订单到达{{platform}}本地仓库，您将被通知支付最终的物流费用，并收到您的订单的取货地点。","product-th-products-inbound":"产品入站","product-th-products-inbound-desc":"当产品到达1688tech本地仓库时，您将被提醒支付运费。","product-th-products-order-placement":"您可以在1688tech选择产品，并选择仅在下订单时支付产品费用。","product-th-products-order-placement-n":"您可以在以下位置选择产品{{platform}}并选择在下单时只支付产品费。","product-th-products-order-placement-normal":"您可以在1688tech选择产品，此时您只需要支付产品费用。","product-th-products-order-placement-normal-n":"您可以在以下位置选择产品{{platform}}此时您只需要支付产品费用。","product-th-quality-inspection":"质量检验与称重","product-th-quality-inspection-desc":"1688商家将产品发送到1688.com的中国仓库，在那里我们进行质量检查和称重，然后再将运费账单发送到您的帐户。","product-th-quality-inspection-desc-n":"1688商家送产品至{{platform}}的中国仓库，我们在那里进行质量检查和称重，然后将运费账单发送到您的账户。","purchase-add-new-address":"添加新地址","purchase-cart-one-piece-dropship":"一件Dropship","purchase-cart-sample":"样品","purchase-cart-wholesale":"批发","purchase-detail-no1-ordercreated":"1号订单已创建","purchase-detail-ordernumber":"订单号","purchase-detail-pstatus":"状态","purchase-detail-supplier":"供应商","purchase-list-copy-the-order-number-and-initiate-a-whatsapp-chat":"复制订单号并启动WhatsApp聊天","purchase-list-generate-unpaid-order-number":"生成未付订单号","purchase-list-hello-we-have-received-the-order-inquiry-document-submitted-by-you":"您好，我们已收到您提交的订单询价文件。我们将尽快为您的订单提供报价。","purchase-list-if-you-need-to-keep-track-of-the-progress-of-your-order-inquiry-in-a-timely-manner":"如果您需要及时跟踪订单查询的进度，请通过WhatsApp与代理商联系以获取最新更新。","purc