/*
 * Return a new Decimal whose value is the inverse of the hyperbolic sine in radians of the value
 * of this Decimal.
 *
 * Domain: [-Infinity, Infinity]
 * Range: [-Infinity, Infinity]
 *
 * asinh(x) = ln(x + sqrt(x^2 + 1))
