 * asin(x) = 2*atan(x/(1 + sqrt(1 - x^2)))
 *
 * asin(0)       = 0
 * asin(-0)      = -0
 * asin(1/2)     = pi/6
 * asin(-1/2)    = -pi/6
 * asin(1)       = pi/2
 * asin(-1)      = -pi/2
